hared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997530/extras/427494df1f71d2842f78c50f163852ae.webm?t=1728688749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997530/extras/427494df1f71d2842f78c50f163852ae.mp4?t=1728688749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
